d":562332992,"node_id":"RA_kwDORZ9jAc4hhIVA","name":"CliRelay_0.5.2_linux_amd64.tar.gz","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/gzip","state":"uploaded","size":16440423,"digest":"sha256:f85272ebf8053dfcb321b6769a938ded88710f716de5d84eef77111a2c9e0622","download_count":10,"created_at":"2026-09-14T01:53:36Z","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:53:38Z"},{"id":562332994,"node_id":"RA_kwDORZ9jAc4hhIVC","name":"CliRelay_0.5.2_linux_arm64.tar.gz","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/gzip","state":"uploaded","size":15086070,"digest":"sha256:12ee187a32c602a080ef598f8a701b6e65cd65bcbc702fe92429a556f95e77cf","download_count":2,"created_at":"2026-09-14T01:53:36Z","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:53:38Z"},{"id":562332993,"node_id":"RA_kwDORZ9jAc4hhIVB","name":"CliRelay_0.5.2_windows_amd64.zip","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/zip","state":"uploaded","size":16774115,"digest":"sha256:923b3e6395bee6a62a4cbf30047ec976cbe9b0e64ef69e163a67b0d759daf2f0","download_count":4,"created_at":"2026-09-14T01:53:36Z","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:53:38Z"},{"id":562332996,"node_id":"RA_kwDORZ9jAc4hhIVE","name":"CliRelay_0.5.2_windows_arm64.zip","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/zip","state":"uploaded","size":15213689,"digest":"sha256:f8020c3a44f43e6c797bd2124be37d4205b6051924591d5c99540c08e182f65d","download_count":1,"created_at":"2026-09-14T01:53:36Z","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:53:37Z"}],"body":"# v0.5.2 - 模型多模态探测、Antigravity 思考重放与账号并发队列 / Modality Probing, Antigravity Thinking Replay and Concurrency Queue\n\n## 核心更新亮点 / Highlights\n\n### 1. 模型探测模态塑形与 Codex 图像模型选择 / Modality Probe and Codex Image Carrier\n* **探测协议按模态塑形**：支持为聊天、文生图、文生视频、音频及嵌入模态分别塑形测试探针，返回请求详情、端点与凭据溯源。\n* **Codex 原生图像生成注册与路由**：新增 GPT Image 2.5 图像模型对，开放公共文生图接口，支持在账号级显式绑定图像模型载体。\n* **多租户模态种子补全**：自动将图像与视频模型补填至各租户模型库，修复 PostgreSQL 环境下的执行兼容性。\n\n### 2. Antigravity 思考重放与上限保护 / Antigravity Thinking Replay and Ceiling Guard\n* **家族级思考重放适配**：针对不同上游模型家族（如 Gemini / Claude）遵守各自的思考重放规则，避免非法思维链格式导致上游拒绝。\n* **Claude 输出 Token 硬上限截断**：将 Claude 模型的 `maxOutputTokens` 限制在上游接受的最大安全范围内，杜绝溢出拒绝。\n\n### 3. 账号并发队列与密码防锁死 / Saturated Account Concurrency Queue and Account Safety\n* **饱和账号并发请求排队**：账号并发占满时自动将请求放入排队等待，而非直接返回失败，提升高并发下的请求成功率。\n* **密码重置防锁死与详细校验规则**：重置密码时不再意外触发防爆破锁定；当密码被策略拒绝时，明确返回具体违反的规则说明。\n* **5 小时额度窗口重置锚定**：周期用量结算准确锚定 5 小时重置窗口，移除不必要的预测预热门禁。\n\n---\n\n## 详细改动记录 / Detailed Changes\n\n### 后端 CliRelay\n- **feat(models,codex)**：按模态塑形模型探测协议，支持账号级图像模型选择与管理端链路溯源（#1028）。\n- **fix(antigravity)**：按各模型家族规则重放思维链（thinking），避免协议不兼容报错（#1026）。\n- **fix(antigravity)**：将 Claude 模型 `maxOutputTokens` 截断在上游上限内（#1025）。\n- **fix(portal,identity)**：避免密码重置锁定用户，准确指出拒绝密码违反的策略项（#1024）。\n- **fix(codex)**：打通图像模型路由与 carrier 解析，注册 GPT Image 2.5 并开放 images 端点（#1017, #1018, #1021）。\n- **fix(modelconfig)**：为所有租户自动种子化图像和视频模型，修复 PG 执行问题（#1019, #1020）。\n- **feat(auth)**：账号达到最大并发时进入排队机制，避免直接报错失败（#1016）。\n- **feat(quota)**：锚定 5 小时额度消费窗口并移除旧版预热拦截（#1013, #1014）。\n\n本次更新与前端 codeProxy v0.5.1 协同发布。二进制产物与多架构容器镜像已完成构建并发布至 GHCR。\n"}
